    "evidence_text": "Yakutian Laika\n\nPlanet Laika\n\n All the characters in the game have dog heads, a possible reference to the Soviet space dog Laika.\n\n The game was only released in Japan.\n\nRusso-European Laika\n\nWest Siberian Laika\n\nThe West Siberian Laika or \"WSL\", is a breed of hunting dog and a breed of spitz type.\n\n This was the time the breed began taking modern shape.\n\n Before that hunters only knew of Mansi Laika and Khanty Laika.\n\n The word Laika simply means \"barker\".\n\n Any hunting Laika is a bark pointer (pointing at animal of interest by barking and staying with the animal ).\n\nAndalusian Hound\n\n In the Iberian Peninsula there are cave paintings representing dogs with a strong resemblance to these races.\n\nEast Siberian Laika\n\nLaika\n\nBo (dog)\n\n Bo is a male Portuguese Water Dog.\n\n Bo has occasionally been called \"First Dog\".\n\nBreed standard (dogs)\n\nPortuguese Podengo\n\nThe Portuguese Podengo is an ancient multi-sensory hound (sight and scent) breed of dog from Portugal.\n\n Their coats are either short and 'smooth', or longer and 'wired'.",
